# Copy to .env only if you need to override the defaults.
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset for local development: Vite proxies /api to
# http://127.0.0.1:5000 (see vite.config.js), which keeps API calls
# same-origin so the httpOnly refresh cookie is sent with them.
#
# Set it in production ONLY when the API is on a different host, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.jaapa.in/api
# In that case the backend must run with NODE_ENV=production so the refresh
# cookie is issued as SameSite=None; Secure, and the admin origin must be in
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS on the backend.
# VITE_API_URL=
